            },
            {
              "text": "degenerative sequelae",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "can also be caused by excessive anterolateral soft tissues or posterior soft tissue or osseous abnormalities",
